    "source_scene_file": "scene-041.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 66,
        "printed_page": 66
      }
    ],
    "text": "குமரன்! குமரன்!"
  },
  {
    "id": "naam-s041-d007",
    "scene_id": "naam-s041",
    "scene_ordinal": 41,
    "source_scene_number": 41,
    "source_heading": "காட்சி 41",
    "speaker_label": "மீனு",
    "source_delimiter": ":-",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-041.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 66,
        "printed_page": 66
      }
    ],
    "text": "ஆ...என் குமரா! குமரன்...குமரன்..."
  },
  {
    "id": "naam-s041-d008",
    "scene_id": "naam-s041",
    "scene_ordinal": 41,
    "source_scene_number": 41,
    "source_heading": "காட்சி 41",
    "speaker_label": "குமரன்",
    "source_delimiter": ":-",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-041.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 66,
        "printed_page": 66
      }
    ],
    "text": "சீ...தொடாதே காலை!"
  },
  {
    "id": "naam-s041-d009",
    "scene_id": "naam-s041",
    "scene_ordinal": 41,
    "source_scene_number": 41,
    "source_heading": "காட்சி 41",
    "speaker_label": "மீனு",
    "source_delimiter": ":-",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-041.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 66,
        "printed_page": 66
      }
    ],
    "text": "குமரன்! இது என் குழந்தை அல்ல! இக் குழந்தையைப்பற்றி கடிதத்தில் என்ன எழுதி இருக்கிறது என்று பாருங்கள்!"
  },
  {
    "id": "naam-s041-d010",
    "scene_id": "naam-s041",
    "scene_ordinal": 41,
    "source_scene_number": 41,
    "source_heading": "காட்சி 41",
